068 - On Our Way Rejoicing
 / 
Key: G
Time: 4/4
Tempo: Moderato
Number: 68
Topic: Worship - 

Verse 1:
[G]On our way [F#dim]rejoicing
[C/G]Gladly [Am]let us [D/A]go;
[D/F#]Conquer'd [G/D]hath [D7]our [G/D]Leader,
[Am]Vanquish'd [D/A]is [C/G]the [D/F#]foe.
[D/F#]Christ without, [C/G]our [D/A]safety;
[Em/B]Christ within, [C/G]our joy;
[Em]Who, if we [G]be [C/G]faithful,
[C/G]Can [Am]our [Bm]hope [D7/C]destroy?

Refrain:
[G/D]On our way [D7/C]rejoicing
[Am]As we forward [D/A]move,
[G]Hearken to [C/G]our [G]praises,
[C/G]O [Am]blest [Bm]God [D7/C]of [Em/B]love!

Verse 2:
[G]Unto God [F#dim]the [G]Father
[C/G]Joyful [Am]songs we [D/A]sing,
[D/F#]Unto [G/D]God [D7]the [G/D]Savior
[Am]Thankful [D/A]hearts [C/G]we [D/F#]bring,
[D/F#]Unto [C/G]God [D/A]the [D7/C]Spirit
[Em/B]Bow we [Bm]and [C/G]adore,
[Em]On our way [G]rejoicing
[C/G]Now [Am]and [Bm]evermore.
